  "description": "Afaq is a smooth and modern fragrance that blends juicy fruits with soft florals and a creamy gourmand base. The scent feels elegant, slightly sweet, and versatile, offering a refined balance between freshness and warmth. The opening introduces a bright blend of pear and cassis, creating a juicy, slightly tart sweetness that feels fresh and inviting. The heart develops into jasmine and tuberose, adding a soft, creamy floral layer that enhances the elegance and depth of the fragrance. The base settles into vanilla, musk, and sandalwood, leaving a smooth, warm, and long-lasting trail that feels creamy, clean, and comforting. Afaq is perfect for those who enjoy fruity-floral fragrances with a soft gourmand twist and a clean, musky finish.",
